Why bother waiting
until you can't bear it?

00:54:55.856 --> 00:54:56.857
Dad.

00:55:03.656 --> 00:55:04.657
I owe you

00:55:05.533 --> 00:55:07.118
so much.

00:55:08.369 --> 00:55:10.121
Now you're all mature,
you're saying goodbye?

00:55:13.833 --> 00:55:16.418
But I have one more favor.

00:55:21.298 --> 00:55:24.260
I really…

00:55:31.559 --> 00:55:34.270
I really, really love him so much, Dad.

00:55:34.353 --> 00:55:37.398
But I can't stay next to him right now.

00:55:41.068 --> 00:55:42.903
I can't be a burden to him too.

00:55:52.997 --> 00:55:54.582
Kyeong-do is having…

00:55:56.792 --> 00:55:58.294
a really hard time.

00:56:07.970 --> 00:56:08.846
So…

00:56:11.015 --> 00:56:12.433
please, Dad…

00:56:18.939 --> 00:56:22.735
Will you protect Kyeong-do for me?

00:56:30.659 --> 00:56:32.661
I'm shameless, aren't I?

00:56:33.287 --> 00:56:36.749
Jeez, I don't know
why you're going to New York

00:56:38.292 --> 00:56:40.502
when you can't even speak
your native language properly.

00:56:41.170 --> 00:56:43.255
There's no shame
between parents and children.

00:56:59.188 --> 00:57:00.731
Thank you, Dad.

00:57:02.983 --> 00:57:04.276
I miss you.

00:57:12.368 --> 00:57:14.536
If you do this, what does that make me?

00:57:16.580 --> 00:57:19.625
I knew my father-in-law
was a good man, but…

00:57:19.708 --> 00:57:21.669
The beautiful stories about him
never stop.

00:57:22.253 --> 00:57:26.298
This isn't something to laugh off.
Don't you sense the atmosphere already?

00:57:26.382 --> 00:57:30.427
"I'll bury myself in JARIM," "So proud,"
"I'm rooting for the Seo sisters."

00:57:30.511 --> 00:57:31.553
What now?

00:57:31.637 --> 00:57:34.598
There's no way to sell the company.
It can't be justified anymore.

00:57:34.682 --> 00:57:38.644
That's all in the past.
How was I supposed to know?

00:57:39.436 --> 00:57:40.271
Then tell me.

00:57:40.980 --> 00:57:44.483
How come you, who stayed next to him
for your whole life, didn't know?

00:57:47.278 --> 00:57:48.237
So,

00:57:49.405 --> 00:57:51.907
you started this when this is all you had?

00:57:51.991 --> 00:57:55.452
Since CEO Seo scheduled a meeting,
let's hear her first.

00:58:01.625 --> 00:58:03.544
Let me just ask one thing.

00:58:04.878 --> 00:58:07.214
Most of you here
worked with the late Chairman

00:58:07.298 --> 00:58:10.467
since JARIM used to be JARIM Textile.

00:58:11.093 --> 00:58:12.594
Do you still view these events

00:58:13.554 --> 00:58:16.765
as owner-related risk?

00:58:19.310 --> 00:58:23.814
So do you all agree to appoint a new CEO?

00:58:25.691 --> 00:58:27.359
All my father ever wanted was

00:58:27.443 --> 00:58:32.239
for everyone to be happy and find peace
in JARIM's clothes. That's all.

00:58:33.532 --> 00:58:36.327
With his teaching deep down in my bones,

00:58:36.410 --> 00:58:40.039
I worked hard for JARIM day and night.

00:58:41.040 --> 00:58:42.291
I believe that good deeds

00:58:43.667 --> 00:58:45.711
result in another good deed.

00:58:50.007 --> 00:58:52.968
Do you think that is the only good story
about the late Chairman?

00:58:54.136 --> 00:58:58.349
Someone has attempted
to own MANZAAR before.

00:58:59.725 --> 00:59:03.771
And they even tried to launch a new brand
with MANZAAR's designers.

00:59:03.854 --> 00:59:06.273
What? What do you mean?

00:59:07.066 --> 00:59:08.484
Was it someone among us?

00:59:08.567 --> 00:59:09.693
Yes, among you.

00:59:11.487 --> 00:59:15.115
Here are the testimonies of the designers
who resigned because of that.

00:59:20.537 --> 00:59:23.248
My father let it slide
as if it never happened.

00:59:23.332 --> 00:59:24.833
TESTIMONY AND EVIDENCE

00:59:24.917 --> 00:59:28.295
The other day,
I met Executive Director Choi Jin-sook

00:59:28.379 --> 00:59:32.174
to ask her to be someone JARIM can rely on
and filled her glass with soju.

00:59:32.716 --> 00:59:34.676
Since past is only past.

00:59:35.177 --> 00:59:37.721
But it's confirmed
that she met the executives one by one

00:59:37.805 --> 00:59:42.059
with unconfirmed speculations
and instigated them to sell JARIM.

00:59:43.560 --> 00:59:44.812
Show us.

00:59:48.774 --> 00:59:50.651
This man, Bae Jun-soo,

00:59:51.235 --> 00:59:54.321
receives commission
from buying and selling companies.

00:59:54.405 --> 00:59:55.572
I wonder

00:59:56.865 --> 01:00:00.369
why Director Kang
and Executive Director Choi met with him?

01:00:04.873 --> 01:00:06.041
Executive Director Choi.

01:00:09.002 --> 01:00:12.297
There is a slight misunderstanding.

01:00:13.340 --> 01:00:14.174
I was only--

01:00:14.258 --> 01:00:17.010
Oh, you were just following
Director Kang Min-woo?

01:00:17.803 --> 01:00:19.054
Director Kang Min-woo,

01:00:20.055 --> 01:00:21.849
what was that meeting about?

01:00:24.309 --> 01:00:27.479
If we keep in touch,
it may lead to a good connection.

01:00:27.563 --> 01:00:29.231
It was just a casual meal with no purpose.

01:00:29.314 --> 01:00:31.275
Oh, I see.

01:00:36.280 --> 01:00:37.448
Today,

01:00:39.158 --> 01:00:44.663
I will not remain silent about the scandal
MANZAAR had in the past

01:00:44.746 --> 01:00:48.041
and request the dismissal
of Executive Director Choi Jin-sook.

01:00:51.253 --> 01:00:52.087
Let me remind you

01:00:52.671 --> 01:00:56.758
that I have the right
to dismiss executives.

01:01:12.524 --> 01:01:13.692
Shit!

01:01:22.951 --> 01:01:26.163
Did you go see Dad?

01:01:31.126 --> 01:01:35.255
Dad protects me even in heaven.

01:01:37.591 --> 01:01:40.469
I guess a good man does good things
even after he dies.

01:01:41.595 --> 01:01:42.638
Yes.

01:01:45.265 --> 01:01:46.642
There is another good man.

01:01:48.852 --> 01:01:51.480
Kyeong-do saved JARIM

01:01:52.439 --> 01:01:53.982
and me as well.

01:02:01.657 --> 01:02:03.158
Look how smart he is.

01:02:03.700 --> 01:02:07.496
Just with four suits,
the affair and the divorce setup,

01:02:09.206 --> 01:02:10.582
he covered them all up.

01:02:10.666 --> 01:02:14.419
Because they weren't true.
It's a reporter's duty to reveal it.

01:02:14.503 --> 01:02:16.797
Does groundless mean the truth?

01:02:17.339 --> 01:02:20.884
It's a false report.
It's just a world-shattering false report.

01:02:30.018 --> 01:02:30.852
Is it tough?

01:02:36.984 --> 01:02:38.443
Actually, I'm barely carrying on.

01:02:40.988 --> 01:02:43.991
Do you think you can go to Paris?
Or do you want me to go?

01:02:46.076 --> 01:02:50.038
I'll go. Lucas said
he's curious about my love story.

01:02:50.831 --> 01:02:51.790
I think he's noticed.

01:02:53.959 --> 01:02:57.421
I heard he's a romanticist.
He'll like JARIM even more.

01:03:01.258 --> 01:03:04.219
You should tell Kyeong-do
about the company's situation.

01:03:05.596 --> 01:03:07.014
He needs a hole to breathe through.

01:03:09.600 --> 01:03:10.434
Okay.

01:03:24.364 --> 01:03:26.450
Nam-sook, aren't you coming?

01:03:35.167 --> 01:03:37.544
I'm not going because I'm upset.

01:03:38.879 --> 01:03:40.797
I have a temper too.

01:03:42.841 --> 01:03:45.636
Do I have two children or three?

01:03:46.928 --> 01:03:48.430
I only have one son.

01:03:49.973 --> 01:03:52.934
I only have one. Let him live happily.

01:03:53.852 --> 01:03:55.687
Is that too much to ask?

01:04:00.400 --> 01:04:04.363
You can't do that.
You should know better than that.

01:04:19.252 --> 01:04:21.380
Mom, Dad.

01:04:21.463 --> 01:04:22.297
My baby.

01:04:22.381 --> 01:04:24.341
Why are you quiet?

01:04:24.925 --> 01:04:26.301
Are you fighting?

01:04:26.760 --> 01:04:28.470
No. Were you surprised?

01:04:29.388 --> 01:04:31.139
-Do you want to go to bed?
-Yes.

01:04:31.682 --> 01:04:34.768
Let's go to bed.
Let's sleep with Mommy, my baby.

01:04:51.118 --> 01:04:51.952
Good night.

01:04:54.204 --> 01:04:55.580
I'm lucky.

01:04:57.457 --> 01:05:01.503
To have married the person I love
and to have a child with her.

01:05:04.798 --> 01:05:05.966
I'm lucky.

01:05:09.052 --> 01:05:09.886
I'm off.

01:05:34.119 --> 01:05:35.078
Here.

01:05:36.413 --> 01:05:37.622
Good job.

01:05:40.709 --> 01:05:41.918
Just like that?

01:05:43.754 --> 01:05:45.464
Just a meal would have been fine.

01:05:45.922 --> 01:05:48.467
I'm just showing you that I'm fine.
I'm not craving alcohol.

01:05:49.176 --> 01:05:51.928
First of all,
my first article is full of lies.

01:05:52.012 --> 01:05:53.388
Hey.

01:05:53.472 --> 01:05:54.806
It's not groundless.

01:05:55.682 --> 01:05:58.769
Articles like that exist.
Often in the Entertainment Team.

01:05:59.394 --> 01:06:01.229
Hey, don't you get on his nerves.

01:06:01.313 --> 01:06:04.024
If you rub salt in his wound,
he'll go nuts.

01:06:04.941 --> 01:06:08.445
-How can you leave us out?
-I'm disappointed.

01:06:08.528 --> 01:06:10.197
-What the hell?
-We're joining you.

01:06:10.280 --> 01:06:11.281
How did you know?

01:06:11.364 --> 01:06:12.741
We tailed you.

01:06:12.824 --> 01:06:17.162
How come you're the only ones watching me?
Aren't there any hot guys?

01:06:17.788 --> 01:06:18.914
Han-kyeong.

01:06:19.998 --> 01:06:20.832
I'm right here.

01:06:22.793 --> 01:06:23.919
Are you crazy?

01:06:24.002 --> 01:06:25.754
So obnoxious.

01:06:29.674 --> 01:06:31.593
Assistant Manager,
are you drinking tonight?

01:06:32.511 --> 01:06:35.931
Assistant Manager is soothing his pain
with filtered water.

01:06:36.515 --> 01:06:37.849
He's on a different level from you.

01:06:37.933 --> 01:06:38.892
You…

01:06:38.975 --> 01:06:41.144
-What do you take me for? A loafer?
-Yes.

01:06:42.646 --> 01:06:44.147
You are a loafer.

01:06:44.231 --> 01:06:45.982
You are. You come to our team every day.

01:06:46.066 --> 01:06:47.734
Okay, everyone.

01:06:48.735 --> 01:06:49.903
Let's toast.

01:06:50.403 --> 01:06:52.572
Condolences to
Lee Kyeong-do's doomed love story.

01:06:52.656 --> 01:06:53.615
Cheers.

01:06:59.162 --> 01:07:02.207
Jeez, this is why
the Entertainment Team is annoying.

01:07:02.791 --> 01:07:03.834
Sit down.

01:07:04.376 --> 01:07:05.377
Pass me the chopsticks.

01:07:05.460 --> 01:07:08.088
Reporter Nam. Let's go back to
the different level thing.

01:07:08.171 --> 01:07:09.714
Enough!

01:07:15.595 --> 01:07:17.764
You got something to say?
Why are you still here?

01:07:19.766 --> 01:07:21.643
What do we do about Kang Min-woo?

01:07:22.477 --> 01:07:23.895
He'd throw a tantrum.

01:07:24.354 --> 01:07:26.565
He's more than capable of doing that.

01:07:26.648 --> 01:07:29.985
Jeez, I can't find evidence on him.
I need to bust his ass.

01:07:30.068 --> 01:07:32.696
Do you want me to meet An Da-hye?

01:07:34.281 --> 01:07:38.952
Would it be faster to find Yoo Dan-bi,
or make An Da-hye say something?

01:08:28.752 --> 01:08:29.836
Good night.

01:09:39.948 --> 01:09:41.324
Dongwoon Daily Entertainment Team.

01:09:41.408 --> 01:09:42.242
Hello.

01:09:42.993 --> 01:09:43.827
Yes.

01:09:44.828 --> 01:09:46.121
Okay, one moment, please.

01:09:47.038 --> 01:09:49.040
Assistant Manager, it's for you.

01:09:49.833 --> 01:09:50.667
Okay.

01:09:54.421 --> 01:09:55.505
Lee Kyeong-do speaking.

01:09:55.964 --> 01:09:56.798
It's me, An Da-hye.

01:09:59.592 --> 01:10:00.427
Hi.

01:10:00.510 --> 01:10:01.761
Didroxin.

01:10:03.054 --> 01:10:04.514
I think I know something.

01:10:11.062 --> 01:10:12.063
Come now.

01:10:43.303 --> 01:10:47.474
FUNERAL HALL

01:11:53.498 --> 01:11:56.167
Only if one could entreat Elder Wolha…

01:11:56.251 --> 01:12:00.255
That we be born
with fates exchanged in the next life…

01:12:00.338 --> 01:12:03.007
Lee Kyeong-do?
As in latitude and longitude?

01:12:03.091 --> 01:12:04.843
-Latitude, longitude, Kyeong-do.
-Kyeong-do.

01:12:04.926 --> 01:12:05.885
Kyeong-do.

01:12:08.346 --> 01:12:09.264
Ji-woo.

01:12:09.889 --> 01:12:12.016
-Over a thousand ri away…
-Over a thousand ri away…

01:12:12.100 --> 01:12:13.101
I will die…

01:12:13.184 --> 01:12:14.185
I will die…

01:12:14.269 --> 01:12:15.353
And you live.

01:12:15.436 --> 01:12:16.271
And you live.

01:12:16.354 --> 01:12:17.272
Why?

01:12:17.814 --> 01:12:19.691
-Are you going to marry another woman?
-What?

01:12:21.025 --> 01:12:22.861
Then you shall know

01:12:24.863 --> 01:12:26.281
the depth of my sorrow.